# A RUN'S OUTPUT IS NOT SOMEBODY ELSE'S TO CHECK OUT: THE THROWAWAY DATABASES, THE DECODED
# CLIPS, AND EVERY REPORT A REPLAY WRITES. IGNORING THESE BY NAME MEANT A RUN GIVEN ITS OWN
# --db WENT STRAIGHT INTO GIT, SO IT IS THE WHOLE FOLDER NOW, WITH THE KEPT ONES NAMED BACK.
runs/*

# THE MEASUREMENTS WORTH KEEPING: THE NUMBERS A CHANGE IS ARGUED AGAINST LATER.
!runs/regress-wide.log
!runs/vb-parakeet.log
!runs/vb-whisper.log
!runs/voicebench-parakeet.json
!runs/voicebench-whisper.json
